Language English
Debug Off

Book BenAfter Random No Keep Looped
    Triggered By @BenAfter

    Prolog
        Text """
			Benjamin looks around the room, like is he trying to figure out
			what you are doing.
		"""
    End Prolog

    Page Dirt
        Button "<<Is the whole house this dirty?>>"

        Text """
            <<Well,>> he starts, <<10 years ago the house was packed quickly and
			then close up. There has been no one here since then, so expect the
			worst.>>
    
            You are not encouraged.
        """

        If Not exploredBackyardNicely Then Text """
            <<Well,>> he snaps, <<the house sat unused these last 10 years. You
			were hired to clean, not criticize.>>
        
            This man clearly does not like you.
        """

        Epilog """
			Benjamin seems surprised you asked about dirt. Odd since you
			were hired to clean.
		"""
    End Page Dirt
    
    Page Footprints
        Button "<<There are footprints in the dust by that door...>>"
        
        Text """
			<<I think the handyman was in the house yesterday. They must be
			his.>>
		"""
        
        If Not exploredBackyardNicely Then Text """
            <<Then you should sweep it up. That's what you're here for, not to 
			complain about dirt.>>
        """

        Epilog """
			You notice Benjamin glancing nervously at the footprints. <i>Is
			something going on?</> you wonder.
		"""
    End Page Footprints

    Page AnythingElse
        Button "<<Is there anything else we need to know?>>"
    
        Add TokenInvestigatorsDiningRoom, TokenExploreBackyardViaDiningRoomBlocked!
        
		Text QItemBrassKey """
            <<Oh, my, yes. Here's the key you'll need to open doors throughout
			the house.>>
    
            Gain the {c:QItemBrassKey} common item.
    
            <<I must be going. Take your time and send someone to fetch me if
			you need anything.>>
        
            Move any investigators who are outside one space into the
			{c:TileDiningRoom}.
			
			Ben shuts the door behind you. <i>Was that the lock turning?</i>
			you ask yourself. Discard the Purple Man token and place an
			Explore token as indicated.
        """
    
        If Not exploredBackyardNicely Then Text QItemBrassKey """
            <<What?>> he growls. <<Oh, here's the key to the house. Don't lose
			it.>>
        
            As he turns to walk out, he drops the key in your direction. Place
			the {c:QItemBrassKey} common item in Ben's space. Once outside,
			Benjamin barks, <<Everyone inside. No dawdling.>>

			Move any investigators who are outside intto Ben's space.
        
            Ben slams the door shut behind him. <i>Was that the lock
			turning?</i> you ask yourself. Discard the Purple Man token and
			place an Explore token as indicated.
        """
    
		Remove TokenInvestigatorsDiningRoom, TokenDiningRoomBen
		
		Trigger @ClearAllMythosFlags
		
		$mythosHelp = true
		$mythosFlavor = true
		$mythosMinor = true
		$mythosIndoors = true
        $MythosKey = true
    	$mythosDiningRoom = true
			
		talkedToBenAnythingElse = true 
        talkedToBenCount = talkedToBenCount + 1

        Trigger @TalkedToBenAfter
		Exit
    End Page AnythingElse
	
	Page AnythingElseJournal
		Not Visible
		Triggered By @TalkedToBenAfter If Not foundJournal
		
		Text """
			At your feet you see a book that looks identical to the one Benjamin
			dropped outside. He seems to have dropped it again. <i>How is that
			possible?</i> you ask yourself.
			
			Something here doesn't feel right.
		"""
		Exit
	 End Page AnythingElseJournal
 End Book BenAfter
